### B. Configuration Dataclasses (in order)
1. `BaseConfig` - Base model configuration
2. `BaseExpDenseConfig` - Dense baseline configuration  
3. `FlashAttentionConfig` - Flash attention model configuration
4. `MoEConfig` - Mixture of Experts configuration
5. `OptimizeConfig` - Training optimization configuration
6. `DownstreamConfig` - Downstream task configuration

### C. Helper Functions/Classes (in dependency order)
1. `get_experiment_configs()` - Returns experiment name → config mapping
