### E. Main Model Classes (in order)
1. `BaselineTransformer` - Standard transformer baseline
2. `FlashAttentionTransformer` - Flash attention transformer
3. `FlashMoETransformer` - Flash attention + MoE transformer

### F. Embedding Extraction
